                <h3 id="menu-decision-use-cases">Decision Use Cases</h3>
                <a href="/blog/vendor-demo-script-erp-buyers-what-to-ask/">Vendor demo script</a>
                <a href="/guides/how-to-run-erp-rfp/">ERP RFP process</a>
                <a href="/guides/erp-requirements-audit-checklist-australia/">Requirements audit checklist</a>
                <a href="/blog/implementation-partner-due-diligence-ten-questions/">Partner due diligence</a>
