                <a href="/blog/erp-priorities-professional-services-project-firms/">Professional services</a>
                <a href="/guides/construction-engineering-erp-australia/">Construction and engineering</a>
                <a href="/blog/retail-erp-omnichannel-stock-accuracy-margin-controls/">Retail and ecommerce</a>
              </section>
              <section class="mega-menu-column" aria-labelledby="menu-industry-systems">
                <h3 id="menu-industry-systems">Industry System Checks</h3>
                <a href="/compare/business-central-food-addons-vs-justfood/">Food ERP add-ons vs vertical ERP</a>
                <a href="/guides/netsuite-warehouse-management-bins-vs-wms/">NetSuite warehouse fit</a>
